{"step_index":1163,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:56Z","thinking":"Focusing on the request, it's a targeted search. The goal is to re-attempt filling in missing business numbers, but only for the cases where they were initially absent and remain blank now. This needs an exhaustive search across all available databases.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Extract remaining blank companies for ultra deep search","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst ExcelJS = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/fill_missing_business_numbers/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nconst SCRATCH_DIR = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch';\nconst xlsxPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_최종.xlsx';\n\nasync function run() {\n  const wb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await wb.xlsx.readFile(xlsxPath);\n  const ws = wb.worksheets[0];\n  \n  const blanks = [];\n  for (let r = 2; r <= ws.rowCount; r++) {\n    const row = ws.getRow(r);\n    const bizno = row.getCell(4).value;\n    if (!bizno || String(bizno).trim() === '') {\n      blanks.push({\n        rowNumber: r,\n        seq: row.getCell(2).value,\n        gubun: row.getCell(1).value,\n        name: row.getCell(3).value ? String(row.getCell(3).value).trim() : '',\n        year: row.getCell(5).value ? String(row.getCell(5).value).trim() : '',\n        month: row.getCell(6).value ? String(row.getCell(6).value).trim() : '',\n        ceo: row.getCell(7).value ? String(row.getCell(7).value).trim() : '',\n        phone: row.getCell(8).value ? String(row.getCell(8).value).trim() : '',\n        fax: row.getCell(9).value ? String(row.getCell(9).value).trim() : '',\n        gu: row.getCell(10).value ? String(row.getCell(10).value).trim() : '',\n        address: row.getCell(11).value ? String(row.getCell(11).value).trim() : '',\n        category: row.getCell(12).value ? String(row.getCell(12).value).trim() : ''\n      });\n    }\n  }\n  \n  console.log(`Total remaining blank companies: ${blanks.length}`);\n  fs.writeFileSync(path.join(SCRATCH_DIR, 'remaining_blanks.json'), JSON.stringify(blanks, null, 2), 'utf8');\n}\nrun();\n","Description":"Extract remaining blank companies","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\extract_remaining_blanks.js","toolAction":"Creating extract_remaining_blanks.js","toolSummary":"Extract remaining blanks script"}}]}
